on exitFrame
  [  0] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  2] extcall 19 .............................. initber1()
  [  4] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [  7] pushint8 320 ............................ <320>
  [ 10] pushint8 240 ............................ <240>
  [ 13] pusharglist 2 ........................... <320, 240>
  [ 15] extcall 51 .............................. <point(320, 240)>
  [ 18] pushint8 33 ............................. <33>
  [ 21] set 6 ................................... set the loc of sprite 3 to point(320, 240)
  [ 23] ret
end
